<title>BELGIUM: Albanian foreign minister cancels Luxembourg trip.</title>
<headline>Albanian foreign minister cancels Luxembourg trip.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-01-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Albanian Foreign Minister Tritan Shehu has cancelled Monday's one-day visit to Luxembourg following mass protests in Albania, Luxembourg's foreign ministry said on Sunday.</p>
<p>&quot;The working visit...had to be cancelled following the events in Albania,&quot; the ministry said in a statement.</p>
<p>Violent demonstrations by people who lost their life savings in pyramid investment schemes have spread across the small Balkan nation.</p>
</text>
